🔐 Authentication APIs

### Base URL
`http://localhost:8000`

---

## 1️⃣ USER SIGNUP

**POST**
`/api/auth/signup`

**Body:**
```json
{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "user@gmail.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "role": "user"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "User registered successfully",
  "user": {
    "id": "...",
    "name": "Test User",
    "email": "user@gmail.com",
    "role": "user"
  },
  "accessToken": "..."
}
```

---

