  "role": "organizer"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
  "message": "User registered successfully",
  "user": {
    "id": "...",
    "name": "Event Organizer",
    "email": "organizer@gmail.com",
    "role": "organizer"
  },
  "accessToken": "..."
}
```

